<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00237">
	<title>Periodic inspection</title>
	<conbody>
		<p>It is recommended that all seat belts be inspected periodically for wear or damage of any kind. Any damaged parts should be replaced as soon as possible.</p>
	</conbody>
